{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50731","headline":"投河阳右仆射 · 张祜","name":"投河阳右仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黠虏构搀抢，（应作「欃枪」或「搀枪」。\n）将军首出征。\n万人旗下泣，一马陈前行。\n对敌枭心死，冲围虎力生。\n雪霜齐擐甲，风雨骤扬兵。\n指点看鞭势，喧呼认前声。\n狂胡追过碛，贵主夺还京。\n黑夜星华朗，黄昏火号明。\n无非刀笔吏，独传说时英。\n（本卷均见南宋蜀刻本《张承吉文集》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}